. * nwergm tutorial 3: MCMC diagnostics and goodness of fit
. * Requires the core nwcommands and the package nwergm.
. 
. nwwebuse lazega, nwclear

. encode practice, generate(prac)

. 
. * a short interval between draws: the defaults of nwergm up to 1.1 (since 1.2 the defaults are those of R's ergm, 1024
>  and 16384)
. nwergm lazega_fr, edges mutual nodematch(prac) nodeicov(seniority) gwesp(0.5) seed(1) mcmcinterval(50) mcmcburnin(3000
> )

