nodeicov_seniority|     passed      301   658.1714    passed
gwesp_0.5       |     passed        1    44.4853    passed
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note: Stationary = passed a Cramer-von-Mises test on the chain's own cumulative-sum path (Heidelberger & Welch 1983), di
> scarding an increasing initial fraction (up to 50%) until it does - Start is the first retained iteration once it pass
> es, FAILED means no discard fraction achieved stationarity. HW test additionally requires the retained portion's own 9
> 5% CI halfwidth to be within eps() (default 10%) of its own mean - a separate, stricter precision check, only meaningf
> ul once stationarity itself has passed.

MCMLE's own convergence test was satisfied after   1 iteration(s).
Note: a satisfied convergence test is a necessary check, not proof of a converged fit - inspect the autocorrelation/ESS 
> above, and consider increasing mcmcsamplesize()/mcmleiterations() if acceptance rate or ESS looks poor.

